    "---\n",
    "## 📖 Quick Reference\n",
    "\n",
    "| Step | What to do |\n",
    "|------|------------|\n",
    "| 1 | Get **Groq API key** (free) → [console.groq.com](https://console.groq.com) |\n",
    "| 2 | Get **ngrok token** (free) → [dashboard.ngrok.com](https://dashboard.ngrok.com) |\n",
    "| 3 | Run cells 1 → 2 → 3 → 4 in order |\n",
    "| 4 | Click the purple **Open DocuMind** button |\n",
    "| 5 | Upload PDF/TXT → click **⚡ Process** → start chatting! |\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🏗️ Architecture\n",
    "```\n",
    "PDF/TXT Upload\n",
    "     │\n",
    "     ▼\n",
    "DocumentProcessor (PyMuPDF + RecursiveTextSplitter)\n",
    "     │ chunks\n",
    "     ▼\n",
    "VectorStoreManager (MiniLM-L6-v2 embeddings → FAISS index)\n",
    "     │ top-k similar chunks\n",
    "     ▼\n",
    "RAGChain (Query rewrite → Retrieve → LLaMA 3 via Groq → Answer)\n",
    "     │\n",
    "     ▼\n",
    "Streamlit Chat UI (dark theme + source chips)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### Available LLM Models (via Groq)\n",
    "| Model | Best for |\n",
    "|-------|----------|\n",
    "| `llama3-70b-8192` | Best quality answers |\n",
    "| `llama3-8b-8192` | Fastest responses |\n",
    "| `mixtral-8x7b-32768` | Longer documents (32K context) |\n",
    "| `gemma2-9b-it` | Lightweight, good quality |"
   ]
  }
 ]
